PewterCity_House3_Text_Mother::
    .string "My boy trains at the GYM every\n"
    .string "day.\p"
    .string "He always comes home smelling of\n"
    .string "smoke and sulfur.$"

PewterCity_House3_Text_Boy::
    .string "I'm going to be a GYM LEADER\n"
    .string "one day!\p"
    .string "LEADER KAY says I need a strong\n"
    .string "FIRE POKéMON first.$"

PewterCity_House3_Text_MotherAsk::
    .string "My son's POKéMON fainted deep in\n"
    .string "the forest and he cried all\lnight.\pA REVIVE would mean the world.$"

PewterCity_House3_Text_MotherOffer::
    .string "A REVIVE! Would you really give\n"
    .string "it to my son?$"

PewterCity_House3_Text_MotherGives::
    .string "You are an angel! He's smiling\n"
    .string "again!\pThis was my husband's. A trainer\n"
    .string "should carry it.$"

PewterCity_House3_Text_MotherNo::
    .string "I understand. Please be safe out\n"
    .string "there.$"
